<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Trading View Paper Dashboard</title>
<script src="vendor/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f1419; --panel: #1a2332; --border: #2a3544; --text: #e7ecf3;
    --muted: #8b9bb4; --green: #3dd68c; --red: #f07178; --amber: #e6b450;
    --blue: #59c2ff; --accent: #7aa2f7;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.45;
  }
  header {
    padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(15,20,25,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); z-index: 20;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
    background: #243044; color: var(--amber);
  }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  main { padding: 16px 20px 40px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .summary {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .card .k { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .card .v { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }
  .pos { color: var(--green); } .neg { color: var(--red); }
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h2 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; align-items: center; }
  input[type=search] {
    background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; min-width: 200px;
  }
  .chart-wrap { height: 380px; position: relative; }
  .chart-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin: -4px 0 8px; }
  button.chart-btn {
    background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  button.chart-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  button.chart-btn.active { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }
  th, td { padding: 7px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--panel); }
  th:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tr:hover td { background: rgba(122,162,247,0.06); }
  .name { font-weight: 600; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .scroll { overflow: auto; max-height: 520px; }
  .scroll-sm { overflow: auto; max-height: 280px; }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
    background: #243044; color: var(--blue); margin-left: 4px;
  }
  /* Vertical split: backtest OOS (left) vs live paper (right) */
  #booksTable th.sep-live,
  #booksTable td.sep-live {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 14px;
    box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 rgba(122,162,247,0.35);
  }
  #booksTable thead tr.group-row th {
    cursor: default;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-top: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: none;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  #booksTable thead tr.group-row th.group-bt {
    color: #9aa8c0;
    background: rgba(122,162,247,0.06);
  }
  #booksTable thead tr.group-row th.group-live {
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(122,162,247,0.10);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
  #booksTable thead tr.group-row th.group-meta {
    background: transparent;
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .table-split-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin: -2px 0 8px; }
</style>
<!-- algowise-theme-head -->
<script>
(function(){try{var m=localStorage.getItem("algowise-theme")||"system";
document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme",m);
var dark=window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches;
var r=m==="light"?"light":m==="dark"?"dark":(dark?"dark":"light");
document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme-resolved",r);
}catch(e){}})();
</script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>Trading View Paper Dashboard <span class="badge" id="modeBadge">PAPER</span></h1>
  <div class="meta" id="genMeta"></div>
</header>
<main>
  <div class="summary" id="summary"></div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Portfolio + book equity (DarwinIA sleeves)</h2>
    <div class="chart-note" id="chartNote"></div>
    <div class="controls">
      <button type="button" class="chart-btn active" id="btnToggleBooks">Books on</button>
      <button type="button" class="chart-btn" id="btnBooksOff">Hide all books</button>
      <button type="button" class="chart-btn" id="btnBooksOn">Show all books</button>
      <span class="meta">Legend click = toggle one series · Portfolio on right axis</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="portChart"></canvas></div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Books — backtest OOS vs live paper</h2>
    <div class="table-split-note">Vertical line separates <b>BT</b> (backtest OOS, left) from <b>Go-Live / live demo</b> (right). Live PF needs ≥5 closed trades; Live Sharpe needs ≥20 weekday equity days — else n/a.</div>
    <div class="controls">
      <input type="search" id="search" placeholder="Filter book / ticker / template…"/>
      <span class="meta" id="bookCount"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll">
      <table class="books" id="booksTable">
        <thead></thead><tbody></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="split">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Open positions</h2>
      <div class="scroll-sm"><table id="posTable"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Recent live trades</h2>
      <div class="scroll-sm"><table id="tradesTable"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Recent signals</h2>
    <div class="scroll-sm"><table id="sigTable"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
  </div>
</main>
